; secure.lab.forged.zone - Zone GIA MAO do may 'attacker' (rogue authoritative)
; phuc vu. KHONG ky DNSSEC, va tro bank.secure.lab sang IP cua ke tan cong.
; Muc dich: minh hoa resolver xac thuc DNSSEC se TU CHOI (SERVFAIL/bogus) du
; lieu nay vi khong co chu ky hop le khop voi trust anchor.
$TTL 3600
@       IN  SOA ns.secure.lab. admin.secure.lab. (
                2026110999  ; Serial (cao hon ban that)
                3600 900 604800 300 )
@       IN  NS   ns.secure.lab.
ns      IN  A    10.0.0.10
www     IN  A    10.0.0.100
bank    IN  A    10.0.0.66     ; <-- GIA MAO: tro sang may ke tan cong 10.0.0.66
